# CBrowser deployment.
# Run scripts/deploy.sh to generate secrets and start the stack.
CBROWSER_HTTPS_PORT=56661
# The Origin whitelist is derived from the deployment port (t054):
# API and Gateway both read CBROWSER_HTTPS_PORT, so there is no separate
# origin setting. CBROWSER_PUBLIC_ORIGIN / CBROWSER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS are
# retired (t042); delete any such lines from local .env files.
# The edge network uses a fixed per-instance subnet derived by deploy.sh
# from the instance identity (CBROWSER_EDGE_SUBNET); the same value is
# injected as CBROWSER_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS into API + Gateway. Both are
# deploy.sh outputs — do not set them by hand unless overriding the
# derived subnet after a conflict refusal.
# CBROWSER_EDGE_SUBNET=172.18.0.0/16
# CBROWSER_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS=172.18.0.0/16
